<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>前两层改的都是「生成」—— 那谁能改「能不能上线」</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 400, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>Prompt</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.5}}>改模型说什么</Text><Box style={{height: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.18)", marginTop: 16}}></Box><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)", marginTop: 16}}>Context</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.5}}>改模型看到什么</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 22}}>两层都改不了：这一步能不能发生</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 728, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 14}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 12}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 70, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>权限</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 70, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>沙箱</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 70, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>工具</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 260, height: 116, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.05)", borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "2px dashed rgba(15,110,86,0.55)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 700, color: "#1C1F23"}}>模型</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 12}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 70, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>验证门禁</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 70, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>执行记录</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 70, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>CI</Text></Box></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 20, lineHeight: 1.5}}>答案在模型外面那圈——这圈东西叫 harness。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12}}>〔边界〕它默认的前提是「这一圈是存在的」——而这恰恰是很多团队没有的。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>08 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
